v1.0.55 build 75: pre-warm Cupertino pickers at launch & RepaintBoundary wheel

- main.dart: added _CupertinoPickerPrewarmer in MaterialApp.builder (behind
  opaque MainScaffold). Pre-builds CupertinoDatePicker and CupertinoPicker
  for 1.5s on app launch, pre-warming HarfBuzz font shaping (50+ calls to
  TextPainter.computeMaxIntrinsicWidth), date localization tables, and GPU
  SkSL/Impeller wheel shaders before the user ever opens a picker.
- sheet_picker.dart: wrapped CupertinoDatePicker inside SlideTransition with
  RepaintBoundary, keeping the rasterized wheel as a cached GPU layer during
  the slide translation rather than repainting every frame.
